['Here is a simple implementation using linked list and pthread library for thread safety:

```c
#include <pthread.h>
#include <stdlib.h>
#include <time.h>

typedef struct NFAPI_CRC_INDICATION_PDU {
    int RX_UE_INFORMATION_TAG;
    unsigned short RNTI;
